   - Now, **flip the 4-minute hourglass**.
4. **Wait 4 minutes**:
   - The 4-minute hourglass will completely empty.
   - The **9-minute mark** will be achieved.
   - When the 7-minute hourglass is done, the 4-minute hourglass has 1 minute left.

